{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with pca_n2000 encoder and transformer aggregation on multiprofile data, achieving validation accuracy of 0.519 (lower than the current best of 0.653). The result suggests that the RNA encoder choice may influence transformer aggregation effectiveness, but uncertainty remains about whether this reflects encoder-specific capabilities or uncontrolled factors. Further comparisons with other encoders and fusion strategies are needed to clarify interactions between modalities and aggregation methods."
}

